# text = Jude , though he already had his doubts about this gentleman's medicines , felt him to be unquestionably a travelled personage , and one who might be a trustworthy source of information on matters not strictly professional replied the long thin man said Jude gratefully , but in gasps , for the amazing speed of the physician's walk kept him in a dog-trot which was giving him a stitch in the side said Jude Jude then dropped behind , waited a few minutes to recover breath , and went home with a consciousness of having struck a blow for Christminster .
