# text = The school-master was unprepared for such a proposal he said Jude said she was disposed to do so , he thought , and his ingenious arguments on her natural fitness for assisting Mr . Phillotson , of which Jude knew nothing whatever , so influenced the schoolmaster that he said he would engage her , assuring Jude as a friend that unless his cousin really meant to follow on in the same course , and regarded this step as the first stage of an apprenticeship , of which her training in a normal school would be the second stage , her time would be wasted quite , the salary being merely nominal .
