# text = When they had sat and eaten , Jude impulsively placed his hand upon hers ; she looked up and smiled , and took his quite freely into her own little soft one , dividing his fingers and coolly examining them , as if they were the fingers of a glove she was purchasing she said She had touched the subject at last said Jude Her ever-sensitive lip began to quiver , and her eye to blink , at something this reproof was deciding her to say he said soothingly said she , with the perverseness that was part of her He glanced at her and their eyes met , the reproach in his own belying his words .
