# text = A resumption of this investigation was the outward and apparent hobby of Phillotson at present -- his ostensible reason for going alone into fields where causeways , dykes , and tumuli abounded , or shutting himself up in his house with a few urns , tiles , and mosaics he had collected , instead of calling round upon his new neighbours , who for their part had showed themselves willing enough to be friendly with him .
