# text = It was a contrite little note from Sue , in which she said , with sweet humility , that she felt she had been horrid in telling him he was not to come to see her , that she despised herself for having been so conventional ; and that he was to be sure to come by the eleven-forty-five train that very Sunday , and have dinner with them at half-past one .
