# text = As strange wild birds are seen assembled on some lofty promontory , meditatively pausing for longer flights , or to return by the course they followed thither , so here , in this cliff-town , stood in stultified silence the yellow and green caravans bearing names not local , as if surprised by a change in the landscape so violent as to hinder their further progress ; and here they usually remained all the winter till they turned to seek again their old tracks in the following spring .
