# text = Then the slim little wife of a husband whose person was disagreeable to her , the ethereal , fine-nerved , sensitive girl , quite unfitted by temperament and instinct to fulfil the conditions of the matrimonial relation with Phillotson , possibly with scarce any man , walked fitfully along , and panted , and brought weariness into her eyes by gazing and worrying hopelessly .
