# text = As she read the four-square undertaking , never before seen by her , into which her own and Jude's names were inserted , and by which that very volatile essence , their love for each other , was supposed to be made permanent , her face seemed to grow painfully apprehensive they were to be parties now , not lovers , she thought a horrid idea Age Length of Residence District and County in which the Parties respectively dwell she said on their way home During the interval before the issuing of the certificate Sue , in her housekeeping errands , sometimes walked past the office , and furtively glancing in saw affixed to the wall the notice of the purposed clinch to their union .
