# text = Here they stood upon the straw that was laid to drown the discordant noise of wheels , where the quaint and frost-eaten stone busts encircling the building looked with pallid grimness on the proceedings , and in particular at the bedraggled Jude , Sue , and their children , as at ludicrous persons who had no business there he said to her fervidly However , beyond the peals of the organ , and the shouts and hurrahs between each piece of oratory , Jude's standing in the wet did not bring much Latin to his intelligence more than , now and then , a sonorous word in _um_ or _ibus_ he sighed after a while
