# text = Jude was in such physical pain from his unfortunate break-down of the previous night , and in such mental pain from the loss of Sue and from having yielded in his half-somnolent state to Arabella , that when he saw his few chattels unpacked and standing before his eyes in this strange bedroom , intermixed with woman's apparel , he scarcely considered how they had come there , or what their coming signalized said Arabella to her father downstairs
